<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1870607152"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:55.219"><div begin="35.060" end="1:03.637" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="35.060" end="39.921" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.060" end="36.143">我要</span> <span begin="37.730" end="38.230">你在</span><span begin="38.230" end="39.921">我身旁</span></p><p begin="42.462" end="48.733" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.462" end="43.643">我要</span> <span begin="45.155" end="45.768">你为</span><span begin="45.768" end="46.563">我梳</span><span begin="46.563" end="48.733">妆</span></p><p begin="49.274" end="51.517" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.274" end="50.386">这夜的风儿</span><span begin="50.386" end="51.517">吹</span></p><p begin="52.723" end="56.557" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="52.723" end="53.194">吹得</span><span begin="53.194" end="54.734">心痒痒</span> <span begin="54.844" end="55.491">我的</span><span begin="55.491" end="56.557">姑娘</span></p><p begin="56.796" end="1:03.637" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.796" end="57.957">我在他</span><span begin="57.957" end="58.939">乡</span> <span begin="1:00.424" end="1:01.692">望着月</span><span begin="1:01.692" end="1:03.637">亮</span></p></div><div begin="1:04.224" end="1:33.789" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:04.224" end="1:11.179" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.224" end="1:05.375">都怪这</span><span begin="1:05.375" end="1:07.546">夜色</span> <span begin="1:07.680" end="1:09.179">撩人的风</span><span begin="1:09.179" end="1:11.179">光</span></p><p begin="1:11.754" end="1:19.052" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:11.754" end="1:12.841">都怪这</span><span begin="1:12.841" end="1:14.867">guitar</span> <span begin="1:15.175" end="1:16.238">弹得太</span><span begin="1:16.238" end="1:16.946">凄</span><span begin="1:16.946" end="1:19.052">凉</span></p><p begin="1:19.245" end="1:22.322" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.245" end="1:20.412">Oh 我要唱着</span><span begin="1:20.412" end="1:22.322">歌</span></p><p begin="1:22.764" end="1:26.546" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.764" end="1:23.276">默默</span><span begin="1:23.276" end="1:24.839">把你想</span> <span begin="1:24.839" end="1:26.546">我的姑娘</span></p><p begin="1:26.822" end="1:33.789" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:26.822" end="1:27.946">你在何</span><span begin="1:27.946" end="1:29.021">方</span> <span begin="1:30.386" end="1:31.647">眼看天</span><span begin="1:31.647" end="1:33.789">亮</span></p></div><div begin="2:04.269" end="2:33.669" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:04.269" end="2:11.224" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:04.269" end="2:05.420">都怪这</span><span begin="2:05.420" end="2:07.591">夜色</span> <span begin="2:07.725" end="2:09.224">撩人的风</span><span begin="2:09.224" end="2:11.224">光</span></p><p begin="2:11.769" end="2:19.017" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:11.769" end="2:12.856">都怪这</span><span begin="2:12.856" end="2:14.882">guitar</span> <span begin="2:15.190" end="2:16.253">弹得太</span><span begin="2:16.253" end="2:16.961">凄</span><span begin="2:16.961" end="2:19.017">凉</span></p><p begin="2:19.237" end="2:22.314" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:19.237" end="2:20.404">Oh 我要唱着</span><span begin="2:20.404" end="2:22.314">歌</span></p><p begin="2:22.722" end="2:26.504" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:22.722" end="2:23.234">默默</span><span begin="2:23.234" end="2:24.797">把你想</span> <span begin="2:24.797" end="2:26.504">我的姑娘</span></p><p begin="2:26.778" end="2:33.669" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:26.778" end="2:27.875">我在他</span><span begin="2:27.875" end="2:29.720">乡</span> <span begin="2:30.406" end="2:31.674">望着月</span><span begin="2:31.674" end="2:33.669">亮</span></p></div><div begin="2:34.284" end="3:03.747" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:34.284" end="2:41.239" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:34.284" end="2:35.435">都怪这</span><span begin="2:35.435" 